{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_1000_place", "source_sha256": "ca283fa4c715964e279d66bef67cfd29ca26053c56d939db10703758cd14d25a", "ja": "屋外ステージ袖", "zh": "户外舞台侧边", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_1001_p", "source_sha256": "6706dbdd98a64dbc2fcc9482ae33a5d7e81914779945aea8b6a5f3624f63dad3", "ja": "（機材トラブルで、ステージの準備が遅れている。\nもうすぐライブの開演時刻だが、間に合うだろうか）", "zh": "（由于器材故障，导致舞台准备延迟，\n已经快到演唱会的开演时间，来不来得及呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "33494997efc057fe4084ca5a9e50ec1cfbf3f86615a83e6a2399a488d13e35fa", "ja": "{$P$}。\nライブの準備が整うまで、場を繋げますか。", "zh": "{$P$}，\n在演唱会的准备工作完成之前，就由我来撑场吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "8655ef51c18ceed5d15b119951f40f5846571deb6928d354cd4ded9e57cec4ef", "ja": "こんなこともあろうかと、手品を準備してきました。\nちょうど、新作のステージマジックができます。", "zh": "我想过可能会出现意外状况，所以事先准备了魔术表演。\n我刚好练好了一种新的舞台魔术，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "6a10e37176fc0e75fa3ea90df8d4850513009d26b52f5ee4ec8971b7ca11ca9f", "ja": "私はいつでも出られます。\n……瑞希におまかせ。", "zh": "随时都可以上场。\n……就交给瑞希吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6b603eff6f6ee02336c1f0900b26ec487e4f37f94fc0de6826be2db7e09fa55e", "ja": "ありがとう、瑞希。\nそれじゃあ、すまないが……頼む！", "zh": "谢谢你，瑞希。\n那么，虽然不太好意思……就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_044miz_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_044miz_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8758d0e70fcff050aafd20deca2ba8fb6bd85c13308d883f80822d33b460334e", "ja": "（ライブの開始は少し遅れたが、瑞希の\n手品のおかげで、ステージは盛り上がった！）", "zh": "（结果演唱会晚了一点开始，但多亏了瑞希的\n魔术表演，演出的气氛十分热烈！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
